(((spell) advice) ((repl) advice) ((init) advice) ((files) define))
; In code run on its behalf, a module's set! of its own name assigns it.
> (as-module '(spell) (set! spell:language (lambda () "assigned")))
> (map car (definition-changes spell:language))
((prog) (groucho words) (spell))
